  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belt of Green Mountains and Blue Skies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the rights of indigenous people in northern Myanmar and protect the natural environment on which the livelihood and traditions of indigenous people depend. The project supports higher educational programs, research and the development of curricula and educational materials that increase understanding of ethnic culture, tradition and languages, as well as human rights and the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
